1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:01,809
Nastic movements are different.

2
00:00:01,809 --> 00:00:07,617
Their direction is fixed by the structure of the organ, whatever the direction of the stimulus.

3
00:00:07,617 --> 00:00:13,255
Some are slow growth movements, like tulip and Crocus flowers opening in warmth.

4
00:00:13,255 --> 00:00:16,640
Others are fast, reversible turgor movements.

